      "post": {
        "operationId": "run",
        "summary": "Run fal endpoint meshy/v7/image-to-3d",
        "description": "The body is fal's input for meshy/v7/image-to-3d, forwarded to fal unchanged; a success answer carries fal's output under `output`. Behaves as fal.queue.v1 describes. Each URL output pointer names the URL itself, and a `*` stands for every item of a list. URL fields nested deeper aren't listed in inputs or outputs; the schemas show them.",
